      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4248",
          "text": "What does it taste like?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4272",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4273",
          "text": "Apricot, jasmine and wildflower honey. It is a light roast of two washed coffees, Ethiopia Guji and Colombia Huila, made for filter and pour-over."
        }
      ]
    },
