    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4622",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4623",
          "text": "The same recipes are in the app, with a timer: the code on the bag opens them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4701",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "heading": 3
      },
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4702",
          "text": "How long is it around?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4724",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4725",
          "text": "It is in every box through June, and $19 for a 340 g bag on its own."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4793",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "heading": 2
      },
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4794",
          "text": "The app"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4801",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "heading": 3
      },
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4802",
          "text": "Do I need the app to keep my subscription?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4844",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4845",
          "text": "No. Everything still works by email and on the website. The app makes it faster: skip, pause or move a delivery in two taps."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4969",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "heading": 3
      },
      "inline": [
        {
          "id": "kr0483lpxzq.4970",
          "text": "The code on my bag does not work"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kr0483lpxzq.5002",
      "type": "list",
      "attrs": {
        "kind": "ordered"
      },
